@startuml
title Arquitetura inicial do RendaFlex

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor "Usuário" as Usuario
rectangle "Frontend\nReact + TypeScript" as Frontend

package "Back-end — Spring Boot" {
  component "FinancialAnalysisController" as FAC
  component "ExpenseSimulationController" as ESC
  component "TransactionClassificationController" as TCC

  component "FinancialAnalysisService" as FAS
  component "ExpenseSimulationService" as ESS
  component "TransactionClassificationService" as TCS

  component "Validation" as Validation
  component "Mappers" as Mappers
  component "PythonModelClient" as Client
  component "GlobalExceptionHandler" as Errors
}

package "Serviço interno Python" {
  component "API interna" as PythonAPI
  component "Classificador de transações" as Classifier
  component "Modelo de perfil financeiro" as ProfileModel
}

cloud "OCI" {
  database "Object Storage\nmodelos serializados" as ObjectStorage
}

Usuario --> Frontend
Frontend --> FAC : POST /api/v1/financial-analyses
Frontend --> ESC : POST /api/v1/expense-simulations
Frontend --> TCC : POST /api/v1/transactions/classify

FAC --> Validation
ESC --> Validation
TCC --> Validation

FAC --> FAS
ESC --> ESS
TCC --> TCS

FAS --> Mappers
ESS --> Mappers
TCS --> Mappers

FAS --> Client
ESS --> Client
TCS --> Client

Client --> PythonAPI
PythonAPI --> Classifier
PythonAPI --> ProfileModel

Classifier --> ObjectStorage : carrega artefato
ProfileModel --> ObjectStorage : carrega artefato

FAC ..> Errors
ESC ..> Errors
TCC ..> Errors
Client ..> Errors

note bottom of ObjectStorage
Uso previsto para etapa posterior.
Depende da estabilização dos modelos.
end note

note right of Validation
A proposta em avaliação não é
tratada como decisão aprovada.
end note

@enduml
